{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/pulls/19658","id":2789474211,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAB0Los6mQ_-j","html_url":"https://github.com/php/php-src/pull/19658","diff_url":"https://github.com/php/php-src/pull/19658.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/php/php-src/pull/19658.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/issues/19658","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/pulls/19658/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/pulls/19658/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/issues/19658/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/statuses/a3e82139c524f29ac5c6c64643f30cad1f76ffe9","number":19658,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"re-use `sprintf()` optimisation for `printf()`","user":{"login":"realFlowControl","id":14161194,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTYxMTk0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14161194?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/realFlowControl","html_url":"https://github.com/realFlowControl","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realFlowControl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realFlowControl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realFlowControl/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realFlowControl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realFlowControl/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realFlowControl/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realFlowControl/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realFlowControl/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realFlowControl/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This PR piggybacks on https://github.com/php/php-src/pull/14546\r\n\r\n`test.php`:\r\n```php\r\n<?php\r\n\r\n$a = 'foo';\r\n$b = 'bar';\r\n\r\nob_start();\r\nfor ($i = 0; $i < 100_000_000; $i++) {\r\n    printf(\"%s-%s\", $a, $b);\r\n    ob_clean();\r\n}\r\nob_end_clean();\r\n```\r\n\r\nSee `hyperfine` run, where `php-orig` is without this patch:\r\n```\r\nhyperfine './php-orig -d opcache.enable_cli=1 test.php' './sapi/cli/php -d opcache.enable_cli=1 test.php'\r\nBenchmark 1: ./php-orig -d opcache.enable_cli=1 test.php\r\n  Time (mean ± σ):     10.490 s ±  0.053 s    [User: 10.421 s, System: 0.038 s]\r\n  Range (min … max):   10.443 s … 10.621 s    10 runs\r\n \r\nBenchmark 2: ./sapi/cli/php -d opcache.enable_cli=1 test.php\r\n  Time (mean ± σ):      8.207 s ±  0.135 s    [User: 8.100 s, System: 0.035 s]\r\n  Range (min … max):    8.077 s …  8.489 s    10 runs\r\n\r\nSummary\r\n  ./sapi/cli/php -d opcache.enable_cli=1 test.php ran\r\n    1.28 ± 0.02 times faster than ./php-orig -d opcache.enable_cli=1 test.php\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe generated opcodes before optimizer:\r\n```\r\n./sapi/cli/php -d opcache.enable_cli=1 -d opcache.opt_debug_level=0x10000 test.php     \r\n\r\n$_main:\r\n     ; (lines=21, args=0, vars=3, tmps=13)\r\n     ; (before optimizer)\r\n     ; /usr/local/src/php/php-src/test.php:1-12\r\n     ; return  [] RANGE[0..0]\r\n0000 ASSIGN CV0($a) string(\"foo\")\r\n0001 ASSIGN CV1($b) string(\"bar\")\r\n0002 INIT_FCALL 0 80 string(\"ob_start\")\r\n0003 DO_ICALL\r\n0004 ASSIGN CV2($i) int(0)\r\n0005 JMP 0016\r\n0006 T8 = ROPE_INIT 3 CV0($a)\r\n0007 T8 = ROPE_ADD 1 T8 string(\"-\")\r\n0008 T7 = ROPE_END 2 T8 CV1($b)\r\n0009 T10 = COPY_TMP T7\r\n0010 ECHO T7\r\n0011 T11 = STRLEN T10\r\n0012 FREE T11\r\n0013 INIT_FCALL 0 80 string(\"ob_clean\")\r\n0014 DO_ICALL\r\n0015 PRE_INC CV2($i)\r\n0016 T14 = IS_SMALLER CV2($i) int(100000000)\r\n0017 JMPNZ T14 0006\r\n0018 INIT_FCALL 0 80 string(\"ob_end_clean\")\r\n0019 DO_ICALL\r\n0020 RETURN int(1)\r\n```\r\n\r\n... and after optimizer:\r\n```\r\n./sapi/cli/php -d opcache.enable_cli=1 -d opcache.opt_debug_level=0x20000 test.php\r\n\r\n$_main:\r\n     ; (lines=18, args=0, vars=3, tmps=3)\r\n     ; (after optimizer)\r\n     ; /usr/local/src/php/php-src/test.php:1-12\r\n0000 ASSIGN CV0($a) string(\"foo\")\r\n0001 ASSIGN CV1($b) string(\"bar\")\r\n0002 INIT_FCALL 0 80 string(\"ob_start\")\r\n0003 DO_ICALL\r\n0004 ASSIGN CV2($i) int(0)\r\n0005 JMP 0013\r\n0006 T4 = ROPE_INIT 3 CV0($a)\r\n0007 T4 = ROPE_ADD 1 T4 string(\"-\")\r\n0008 T3 = ROPE_END 2 T4 CV1($b)\r\n0009 ECHO T3\r\n0010 INIT_FCALL 0 80 string(\"ob_clean\")\r\n0011 DO_ICALL\r\n0012 PRE_INC CV2($i)\r\n0013 T3 = IS_SMALLER CV2($i) int(100000000)\r\n0014 JMPNZ T3 0006\r\n0015 INIT_FCALL 0 80 string(\"ob_end_clean\")\r\n0016 DO_ICALL\r\n0017 RETURN int(1)\r\n```","labels":[{"id":3045702973,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMDQ1NzAyOTcz","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/labels/Category:%20Engine","name":"Category: Engine","description":"","color":"5319E7","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3685479977,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAB0Los7bq_Yp","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/php/php-src/labels/Category:%20Optimizer","name":"Category: Optimizer","description":"","color":"5319E7","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-09-01T11:21:09Z","updated_at":"2025-10-17T11:35:14Z","closed_at":"2025-10-17T11:34:37Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"4939112a51212d1862c6cd108710d40c6ff0972b","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"dstogov","id":2510034,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MTAwMzQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2510034?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dstogov","html_url":"https://github.com/dstogov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dstogov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dstogov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dstogov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.gith